{"id":"321860","name":"菜谱","author":"YK演堃","authorId":"8204167","desc":"","cover":"images/321860/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"3斤"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"1.5斤"},{"name":"生姜","amount":"1斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"50克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"50克"},{"name":"味极鲜","amount":"100克"},{"name":"豆豉","amount":"1斤"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"30克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜红辣椒洗干净","img":"images/321860/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"大蒜生姜都剥好洗净","img":"images/321860/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红辣椒切成段放入搅拌机中","img":"images/321860/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入少量水榨成辣椒酱糊糊","img":"images/321860/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大蒜和生姜去皮切成块放入搅拌机中同样榨成蒜姜糊糊","img":"images/321860/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将榨好的辣椒糊糊和蒜姜糊糊混合搅拌均匀","img":"images/321860/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后倒入大的超过里面","img":"images/321860/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入剩余的所有的材料","img":"images/321860/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌均匀之后大火烧开之后转小火，中途要不停的搅拌，小火半小时左右即可","img":"images/321860/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/321860/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/321860/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/321860/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：搅拌机、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}